'''Puffzerker''' (テッポー, ''Teppō'') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of [[Mr. Puffington]] introduced in the [[Anniversary/12 1/2 Year|12th and 1/2 Anniversary]] stages. They were added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Puffzerker
|image = E 722.png
|first appearance = [[Surging Red Waves]]<br>'''ZL:''' [[Tower of the Time Lord|Sub-chapter 21 - Tower of the Time Lord]]
|money drop = 400¢ - 1,580¢
}}

==Enemy==
Puffzerker functions the same as [[Mr. Puffington]], having incredible speed, attacking at 150 range with 200 piercing range via [[Omni Strike]], and a long backswing that can be interrupted by their 400 knockbacks. Puffzerker differs by dropping less than half as much money, and instead of a guaranteed [[Curse]], they have a 50% chance to [[Weaken]] Cats to 25% for 5 seconds.

Although Puffzerker has lower base stats than Mr. Puffington, the 250% buff given to Puffzerker in [[Zero Legends]] makes them stronger than the 120% Mr. Puffingtons found at the same point in the game  (625,000 HP/37,500 AP > 480,000 HP/36,000 AP).

==Strategy==
Fight this enemy like Mr. Puffington, but use [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Reds]], instead of [[:Category:Anti-Relic Cats|anti-Relics]]. Spam fast meatshields like [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Macho Cat]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] and either use fast-attacking cats to keep juggling Puffzerker or high-damage nukers to kill them quickly. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] is the ideal unit for this, having high damage against Red and a pretty fast attack rate.

